# Line endings, settled: every text file is stored AND checked out as LF, on
# every platform. This makes the result independent of each machine's
# core.autocrlf setting, so no more "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings and
# no CRLF/LF churn in diffs between Windows edits and Linux CI builds.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalized, never diffed as text.
# (.svg is deliberately absent: it is text and benefits from real diffs.)
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary
